        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Javier Frana, Thomaz Koch, Patricia Tarabini\n- Places: Argentina, Brazil, Porto Alegre\n- Organizations: ESPN Latin America\n- Roles: tennis players, tennis commentator\n- Events: French Open, Wimbledon, U.S. National Championships\n\nFacts:\n- Thomaz Koch was born on May 11, 1945 in Porto Alegre, Brazil.\n- Javier Alberto Frana was born on 25 December 1966.\n- Thomaz Koch is a left-handed former tennis player from Brazil.\n- Javier Alberto Frana is a former tennis player from Argentina and a current tennis commentator for ESPN Latin America.\n- Thomaz Koch was a quarter-finalist at the French Open, Wimbledon, and the U.S. National Championships.\n- Patricia Tarabini won the 1996 French Open mixed doubles title with Javier Frana.",
